SUMMARY:Boat panigiri of Agios Stefanos islet\, Elata
LOCATION:Elata\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:For the feast of St Stephen's relics (2 August) the mastic village of Elata celebrates on the islet of Agios Stefanos off Agia Irini bay: boats leave the little harbour of Agia Irini around 18:00 on the eve for vespers and a gathering at the chapel. Small\, unusual and weather-dependent\; bring water and something for the boatman.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#elata-boat-panigiri-of-agios-stefanos-islet-elata
